<section id="operations" class="page"><div class="grid two"><section class="card"><div class="head"><div><div class="title">SLA SÖZLEŞMELERİ</div><div class="section-note">Süre, ödeme, ihlal ve teknik şartlar</div></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Şirket</th><th>Sözleşme</th><th>Kategori</th><th>Tick aralığı</th><th class="num">Tick ödeme</th><th class="num">İhlal cezası</th><th class="num">Başarılı</th><th class="num">İhlal</th><th>Durum</th></tr></thead><tbody id="contractsBody"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="card"><div class="head"><div><div class="title">ALTYAPI YATIRIMLARI</div><div class="section-note">CPU, RAM, ağ, depolama, güvenlik, Ar-Ge ve ekipler</div></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Şirket</th><th>Yatırım</th><th class="num">Seviye</th></tr></thead><tbody id="investmentsBody"></tbody></table></div></section></div></section>
<section id="security" class="page"><div class="grid market-layout"><section class="card"><div class="head"><div><div class="title">GÜVENLİK SKOR TABLOSU</div><div class="section-note">Engellenen ve başarılı saldırılar, kayıp ve güvenlik puanı</div></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Şirket</th><th class="num">Güvenlik</th><th class="num">Kod kalitesi</th><th class="num">Engellenen</th><th class="num">Başarılı saldırı</th><th class="num">Finansal kayıp</th><th>Risk</th></tr></thead><tbody id="securityBody"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="card"><div class="head"><div><div class="title">CANLI MOTOR AKIŞI</div><div class="section-note">Son 300 olay</div></div></div><div id="logs" class="log"></div></section></div></section>
